    {
      "id": "854b306e-e773-4423-aeaf-632c830b4a7d",
      "name": "sandbox simulations",
      "description": {
        "content": "Sandbox-only operations for simulating processing of bank transfers",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "7c1a4b57-eb5b-4eaf-b500-5ccc96feeb30",
          "name": "Sandbox simulations (bank transfers, VAN transfers, or customer verification directives)",
          "request": {
            "name": "Sandbox simulations (bank transfers, VAN transfers, or customer verification directives)",
            "description": {
              "content": "Sandbox-only endpoint with three modes:\n\n**Simulate bank transfer processing** — Omit the body or send an empty JSON object. Processes or fails\nthe last 500 bank transfers on the authorized application or Sandbox account (and initiated micro-deposits).\nIf webhooks are configured, events are delivered. If a bank-to-bank transaction involves two users,\ncall this twice to process debit and credit sides. Returns **200** with a HAL document including `total`.\n\n**Simulate VAN (virtual) transfers** — Send a JSON body with `type` set to `virtual` and a `transfers`\narray (up to 10 items). External transfers are created and processed immediately. Returns **202 Accepted**.\n\n**Simulate verification directives** — For a business Verified Customer in **`retry`** or **`document`**\nstatus, send `type`: `customer-verification`, `_links.customer.href` pointing at that customer, and\n`errorCode` set to one of: `PersonalIDRequired`, `POBoxNotAllowed`, `AddressNotAssociatedWithBusiness`,\n`EINDocumentRequired`. Returns **200** with HAL `_links.self` and `errorCode`. Then **GET** the Customer;\nthe same code appears in `_embedded.errors` for end-to-end testing.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "sandbox-simulations"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/vnd.dwolla.v1.hal+json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/vnd.dwolla.v1.hal+json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"<string>\",\n  \"transfers\": [\n    {\n      \"_link\": {\n        \"destination\": {\n          \"href\": \"<uri>\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"amount\": {\n        \"value\": \"<string>\",\n        \"currency\": \"<string>\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "id": "9848517e-4386-4020-9f67-a615c7c6b5bd",
              "name": "Success. **Bank transfer processing** returns HAL with `total`. **Customer verification directives**\nreturn HAL `_links.self` and `errorCode` (retrieve the Customer for `_embedded.errors`).\n",
